          "content": {
            "mimeType": "application/json",
            "text": "{\"id\":474,\"filmId\":300,\"screeningDate\":\"2026-07-11T16:00\",\"doorsTime\":\"3:30pm\",\"filmTime\":\"4:00pm\",\"capacity\":37,\"ticketsSold\":3,\"price\":1100,\"format\":\"Digital\",\"excludeFromGiftVouchers\":false,\"isPrivate\":false,\"memberOnly\":false,\"film\":{\"id\":300,\"title\":\"THEATRE OF HORRORS: THE SORDID STORY OF PARIS’ GRAND GUIGNOL\",\"description\":\"THEATRE OF HORRORS: THE SORDID STORY OF PARIS’ GRAND GUIGNOL explores the grisly history and pervasive legacy of the Grand Guignol Theatre. \\n\\nOccupying a former chapel in a seedy Pigalle alley, Paris’ Théâtre du Grand-Guignol first welcomed audiences to witness its unflinchingly horrific and naturalistic stage plays in 1897. During the next 65 years of gruesome performances, the ‘Theatre of Death’ developed a distinct brand of drama so sadistic yet brilliant, it captivated the world well beyond its final bow. Today the theatre’s name remains synonymous with macabre plots, and its legacy – from the modern horror genre to tabloid journalism, the true-crime phenomenon and beyond – continues to have a profound impact on popular culture worldwide. \",\"runtime\":120,\"year\":2025,\"country\":\"France, USA\",\"director\":\"David Gregory\",\"imageUrl\":\"https://severinfilms.com/cdn/shop/articles/THEATRE_OF_HORRORS_still1_4fb4ac4d-17e1-4339-b4ce-5ecf019a8810.jpg?v=1756239058\",\"imageCropX\":50,\"imageCropY\":50,\"ageCertificate\":\"18\"}}",
