            "mimeType": "application/json",
            "text": "{\"id\":549,\"filmId\":432,\"screeningDate\":\"2026-08-09T14:00\",\"doorsTime\":\"1:15pm\",\"filmTime\":\"2:00pm\",\"capacity\":37,\"ticketsSold\":1,\"price\":1350,\"format\":\"Digital\",\"excludeFromGiftVouchers\":false,\"isPrivate\":false,\"memberOnly\":false,\"film\":{\"id\":432,\"title\":\"TFFF: AFFECTION AFFECTION + Q&A\",\"description\":\"In the winter on the French Riviera, a teenage girl goes missing on her birthday. Géraldine, an employee in the mayor's office, takes on the role of a detective. Versions of the truth rapidly multiply and she struggles not to be overwhelmed by all the gossip and theories. The unexpected return of her mother will not facilitate her task. Small villages, it is well known, are full of small crimes...\\n\\nThis UK Premiere will be followed by a video Q&A with the directors Alexia Walther & Maxime Matray.\",\"runtime\":101,\"year\":null,\"country\":\"France\",\"director\":\"Alexia Walther & Maxime Matray\",\"imageUrl\":\"https://yxvwcvyczjjes5ua.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/Screenshot%202026-06-29%20at%2012.21.52.png\",\"imageCropX\":50,\"imageCropY\":50,\"ageCertificate\":\"18\"}}",
