            "mimeType": "application/json",
            "text": "{\"id\":546,\"filmId\":425,\"screeningDate\":\"2026-08-09T20:00\",\"doorsTime\":\"7:15pm\",\"filmTime\":\"8:00pm\",\"capacity\":37,\"ticketsSold\":9,\"price\":1350,\"format\":\"Digital\",\"excludeFromGiftVouchers\":false,\"isPrivate\":false,\"memberOnly\":false,\"film\":{\"id\":425,\"title\":\"TFFF: BELIEF IS NOT WITHOUT PATHOS + Q&A\",\"description\":\"The chance discovery of a cache of photographs sets off a spiralling journey into the distant past; aided by a medley of re-enactors, paintings, murals and statues that are trying desperately to make sense of it. A documentary.\\n\\nThis UK Premiere will be followed by a Q&A with the director Owen Vince.\",\"runtime\":92,\"year\":null,\"country\":\"UK\",\"director\":\"Owen Vince\",\"imageUrl\":\"https://yxvwcvyczjjes5ua.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/Screenshot%202026-06-29%20at%2011.44.26.png\",\"imageCropX\":50,\"imageCropY\":50,\"ageCertificate\":\"18\"}}",
